  "body": "The initialization of the feature policy occurs after the navigation completes. But while the child is being navigated it is possible the browser context's policy could change and then inheritence could be incorrect from when the navigation occurred.\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4772#issuecomment-512256128 and in w3c/webappsec-feature-policy#256",
